OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mostly cloudy day with
OL,6,Fisolated showers possible through the
OL,7,Fmorning. Becoming dry through the
OL,8,Fafternoon, with a few cloud breaks and
OL,9,Fsome brief sunny intervals. Feeling
OL,10,Fcool in fresh easterly winds,
OL,11,Fparticularly around the coasts.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloudy with isolated showers
OL,14,Fthrough the evening and overnight,
OL,15,Fthough likely drier later. Brisk
OL,16,Feasterly winds continuing, especially
OL,17,Ffor coastal parts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
