OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FLargely cloudy through the
OL,6,Fmorning, but remaining dry. Some sunny
OL,7,Fspells possible in the afternoon.
OL,8,FEasterly winds easing. Temperatures
OL,9,Fnear normal.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FHigh
OL,12,Fpressure continues to dominate, often
OL,13,Fbringing cloudy conditions with light
OL,14,Frain or showers, and a gentle breeze.
OL,15,FAny morning fog may be slow to clear.
OL,16,FTemperatures around normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
